<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Life-stage client checklist</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #102a43; --navy: #163d59; --teal: #16827a; --mist: #eaf3f4; --gold: #e5ad32;
      --protection: #c94b4b; --liquidity: #b67b00; --accumulation: #16827a;
      --retirement-income: #2f6fb0; --longevity-legacy: #7a4fb5;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: #f4f8f9; font: 18px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
    header.hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--teal)); color: #fff; padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem) clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 4rem) 2.5rem; }
    header.hero .eyebrow { color: #b8ebe5; font-size: .8em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    header.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); margin: .25rem 0 1rem; max-width: 24ch; }
    header.hero p { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0; opacity: .92; }
    nav.stage-nav { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e2ec; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .4rem; padding: .8rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 4rem); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2; }
    nav.stage-nav a { background: var(--mist); border-radius: 99rem; color: var(--navy); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; padding: .4rem .9rem; text-decoration: none; }
    nav.stage-nav a:hover, nav.stage-nav a:focus { background: var(--teal); color: #fff; }
    nav.stage-nav a.checklist-link { background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink); margin-left: auto; }
    main { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 64rem; padding: 1rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 4rem) 4rem; }
    section.stage { border-top: 1px solid #d9e2ec; padding: 2.5rem 0; scroll-margin-top: 4rem; }
    section.stage:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
    section.stage .eyebrow { color: var(--teal); font-size: .8em; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    section.stage h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem); margin: .2rem 0 .3rem; }
    section.stage > p.description { color: #486581; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; max-width: 48rem; }
    ul.questions { display: grid; gap: 1rem; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    ul.questions li { background: #fff; border-radius: .9rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 42, 67, .08); padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; }
    .pillar-tag { border-radius: 99rem; color: #fff; display: inline-block; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .05em; margin-bottom: .5rem; padding: .2rem .65rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
{% for pillar in pillars %}
    .pillar-tag.{{ pillar.id }} { background: var(--{{ pillar.id }}); }
{% endfor %}
    .prompt { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0 0 .4rem; }
    .why { color: #486581; font-size: .92rem; margin: 0; }
    footer { color: #829ab1; font-size: .8rem; padding: 1rem clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 4rem) 3rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Client conversation guide</p>
    <h1>What to ask at every life stage</h1>
    <p>Questions clients and their families should sit with for themselves — not sales questions, self-reflection prompts that make the need for planning concrete. Grouped by the life stage a household is in and the financial pillar each question touches.</p>
  </header>
  <nav class="stage-nav" aria-label="Jump to a life stage">
{% for stage in stages %}
    <a href="#{{ stage.id }}">{{ stage.name }}</a>
{% endfor %}
    <a class="checklist-link" href="index.html">Presentation deck</a>
  </nav>
  <main>
{% for stage in stages %}
    <section class="stage" id="{{ stage.id }}">
      <p class="eyebrow">Life stage</p>
      <h2>{{ stage.name }}</h2>
      <p class="description">{{ stage.description }}</p>
      <ul class="questions">
{% for question in questions_by_stage[stage.id] %}
        <li>
          <span class="pillar-tag {{ question.pillar }}">{{ pillar_names[question.pillar] }}</span>
          <p class="prompt">{{ question.prompt }}</p>
          <p class="why">{{ question.body }}</p>
        </li>
{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
{% endfor %}
  </main>
  <footer>Self-reflection prompts only — not individualized advice. Actual recommendations require a full needs analysis and current licensed product/carrier options.</footer>
</body>
</html>
